G1/G2 preflight matches physical event content/source evidence, preserves immutable starts, rejects altered protected mutations and downgrade/gap evidence, and confines delegated role to system without fake tool refs. Capability/profile gates and original anchorless v1 delivery preservation passed focused real-process checks. The UTF8 receiver rejects stale process scope before decoding and keeps decoder state local to generation.

Product publication remains downstream of validated complete; SQLite commits the product projection and its product checkpoint together. The normal reconciliation scheduler reads that product checkpoint, not the separate FileCheckpointStore evidence. Isolated H1/H2/H3 tests independently verified staging-before-ACK, complete-before-publication, reopening, genuine tool details and canonical preservation on rejection/rollback.

